anEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ومباشرة المعلوم تارة يكون بالحواس الظاهرة وتارة يكون بالقلب فلهذا قال {وإنه لحق اليقين} فإن القلب يباشر الإيمان به ويخالطه كما يباشر بالحواس ما يتعلق بها<cite>«التبيان في أقسام القرآن» 1/192</cite></blockquote></section><div class=\"muy\"><div class=\"muy-head\"><b>Al-Mukhtasar in Interpreting the Noble Qur&#x27;an</b><small>The overall meaning of the verse — not the words of the two shaykhs</small></div><p class=\"muy-text\">51. Indeed, the Qur’ān is the certain truth: there is no doubt and dispute that it is from Allah.</p><a class=\"muy-credit\" href=\"https://quranenc.com/en/browse/english_mokhtasar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation of Al-Mukhtasar in Interpreting the Noble Quran — 2026-11-04 · QuranEnc.com</a></div><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s69a51\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/69-50.html\">Previous verse (69:50)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/69-52.html\">Next verse (69:52)</a></div></main><nav class=\"langs\" aria-label=\"Language\">🌐 <a href=\"/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" data-l=\"ar\">العربية</a> · <b lang=\"en\">English</b> · <a href=\"/ur/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"ur\" lang=\"ur\" data-l=\"ur\">اردو</a> · <a href=\"/id/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"id\" lang=\"id\" data-l=\"id\">Bahasa Indonesia</a> · <a href=\"/tr/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"tr\" lang=\"tr\" data-l=\"tr\">Türkçe</a> · <a href=\"/fr/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\" data-l=\"fr\">Français</a> · <a href=\"/bn/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"bn\" lang=\"bn\" data-l=\"bn\">বাংলা</a> · <a href=\"/ms/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"ms\" lang=\"ms\" data-l=\"ms\">Bahasa Melayu</a> · <a href=\"/fa/ayah/69-51.html\" hreflang=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" data-l=\"fa\">ف